    "frontend/packages/paper-ui/tests/data-display-layout.test.tsx"
  ],
  "changes": [
    "Unified the profile year selector, summary statistics and responsive immersion calendar in one annual record.",
    "Aligned language/activity breakdowns and contest/recent activity sections as grid rows, with consistent heading baselines and spacing.",
    "Grouped activity search, filters and result counts; aligned all outer edges; constrained entry notes instead of the entire section.",
    "Tightened narrow-screen identity/actions and kept search beside Filters so entries become visible sooner.",
    "Replaced empty profile charts and repeated empty summaries with one contextual first-entry invitation; hid unusable activity filters when the record is empty.",
    "Made the log title and actions align with the page container, the recorded activity a contained paper section, and scoring a quieter adjacent context.",
    "Replaced horizontally scrolling editorial/admin review tables with responsive lists of content, status and actions; retained semantic tables for members and contests, with accessible captions hidden when duplicating the page heading.",
    "Reduced admin summary prominence, secondary button emphasis and modal action spacing; kept review actions beside queue records at390px.",
    "Removed Paper field's arbitrary32rem maximum so parent forms own width; added min-inline-size:0 for shrinking grid fields.",
    "Fixed HeatmapChart tooltip measurement to use SVG units and skip measuring hidden text."
  ],
